+# DRAFT G — subscription ownership; NOT APPROVED
+
+Proposed default: a subscription has an explicit owning organization. Cross-tenant
+sharing is denied unless an approved billing-account relation authorizes each
+beneficiary. Neither organization name nor plan ID proves ownership.
+
+Current Organization.subscription is a non-unique FK; Subscription has no owner
+FK. Before implementation, choose exclusive ownership versus explicit shared
+billing. Inventory all references in both Organization and Entitlement, preserve
+historical invoices, and adjudicate conflicting links. No automatic reassignment.
+
+Acceptance: create, partial update, toggles, admin and runtime access all enforce
+the same relationship; unbound/foreign subscriptions deny with a versioned reason;
+sharing and reassignment require auditable authority. Schema/backfill/rollback
+and consumer acceptance are separate approvals. No migration is supplied here.
